Haye sadaat, haye sadaat..(2)<br>
Risalat ka logo sila maangti hai<br>
nabi ki nawasi rida mangti hai<br>
<br>
1. Ye ismat ki malka, ye bint e ali hai<br>
jo pattharo ki barish mein kabse khadi hai<br>
faqad do qadam raasta maangti hai<br>
nabi ki nawasi rida mangti hai<br>
<br>
2. Zibha hogaye iske be misl bhai<br>
rasan mein kaha'n se kaha'n tak hai aayi<br>
ye tumse ba-naame khuda maangti hai<br>
nabi ki nawasi rida mangti hai<br>
<br>
3. Karo nau charagho se roshan ye raahein<br>
khudara jhuka lo ye apni nigaahein<br>
bhala kya ye iske siwa maangti hai<br>
nabi ki nawasi rida mangti hai<br>
<br>
4. Nabi zaadiyo ko satate ho kyu tum<br>
inhe naam lekar bulate ho kyu tum<br>
ye marne ki apne dua maangti hai<br>
nabi ki nawasi rida mangti hai<br>
<br>
5. The farhan o qurbaan bibi ke jumle<br>
mujhe mera bhai khule sar na dekha<br>
ye kehke laee'n se rida maangti hai<br>
nabi ki nawasi rida mangti hai